        "created_at": "2025-07-12T03:21:41.484Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, while solving the BPT 3 problems, i was not able to solve the problems but then i tried to see the files in the respective problem and there were 0 files, that’s why i am not able to get the correct answer in my opinion, i am also attaching the screenshot for reference and please correct me if i am wrong or something.<br>\n<a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sayan\">@sayan</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/atulps\">@AtulPS</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/afnan_pod\">@Afnan_POD</a><br>\nthank you<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/1/e/1e272a2d8ee5874ce346e47000a7a9ec33f70234.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/4iKewl85GwXFDzj7sIWF0riQmWM.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-07-12 084418\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/1/e/1e272a2d8ee5874ce346e47000a7a9ec33f70234.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-07-12 084418\" data-base62-sha1=\"4iKewl85GwXFDzj7sIWF0riQmWM\" width=\"612\" height=\"173\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-07-12 084418</span><span class=\"informations\">612×173 5.81 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
